nd half-elf can coexist without discrimination. She is kind, calm, and popular among trainees. She is a graduate of the facility and a former adventurer, so she is well known for her abilities."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23091"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間と妖精のハーフ「半妖精」の女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教官として施設で働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間と半妖精の差別なき共存を望んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しく落ち着いており、訓練生から人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"施設の卒業者で元冒険者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため実力は折り紙つき。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2777","sourceWorkId":"19719","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間と妖精のハーフ “半妖精” の女性。 教官として施設で働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間と半妖精の差別なき共存を望んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しく落ち着いており、訓練生から人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"施設の卒業者で元冒険者。 そのため実力は折り紙つき。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93007"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e69d124ea24efef6b35e78ecad9845cab8902ac29e372cbf7e8639e496f2e76a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b940ee3494734b1b5e5a04b094e20f8b8760fe05306665d11aaed2fb2ae25129.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深田紗記子","creatorId":"vndb:s1658","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1658","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1658","name":"葵時緒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:86971:93007:17079:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c23092","characterName":"ナタリー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93008","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"86971"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2778"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23092"},"originalCharacterName":"ナタリー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A homunculus (artificial human) created to take care of humans. As such, they have only very ordinary abilities and no special skills. Originally, homunculus do not have emotions, but Natalie was a mistake in the creation process and ended up with emotions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23092"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間の世話をするために製作されたホムンクルス（人造人間）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、ごく平凡な能力しか持たず、特別な能力は無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来ホムンクルスは感情を持ち合わせていないが、ナタリーは製作過程にミスがあり、感情を持ち合わせてしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2778","sourceWorkId":"19719","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間の世話をするために製作されたホムンクルス（人造人間）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、ごく平凡な能力しか持たず、特別な能力は無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来ホムンクルスは感情を持ち合わせていないが、ナタリーは製作過程にミスがあり、感情を持ち合わせてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93008"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/016e16eebe023397b35f00048816ace829b2bb2d1048e8ac34ee477f23e38928.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a323d3e102d3c06e1694a0ce32632bc2f1240881767d4fdf8f0dcc4953525ae1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"立石めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:86971:93008:10027:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c47442","characterName":"アドゥルス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93009","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"86971"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2772"],"vndbCharacterId":"c47442"},"originalCharacterName":"アドゥルス","characterNameSour